<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\chilly_hell.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "光2.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―Where is this...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why am I in a place like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to hurry... and get to <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> hospital room...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "11" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Sorry I'm late."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But where is this? This isn't the hospital room, is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, come on..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's wrong? Why won't you say anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Are you trying to say something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe I imagined it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So you are... trying to say something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Na... tsu..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!? So you can talk!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1" "11" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
Where are you going...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hey, why won't you say anything?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pipipi.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Are you awake?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The room is dark...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Night...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a hospital room...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, can you hear me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At <STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE> words, I slowly nod.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, they say you have </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="いかいよう">a stomach ulcer</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5" RUBY="いかいよう">A stomach ulcer</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, just now, when I hugged <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, it feels like I vomited blood...<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Sure enough, it looks like you'd </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="た">built</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> up a lot of stress. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But at this stage, they say it can be treated with an endoscope and medication."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see... so I really had <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="た">built</STYLE> up more exhaustion than I'd imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> getting anxious...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"How's... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haru... ka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is resting in her own room. So you don't need to worry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> must have taken care of things after that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, my exhaustion went past its limit, all the way to vomiting blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I should have listened to everyone sooner.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'll be right beside you tonight, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. So please rest easy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As always, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> whispers to me in a gentle voice that seeps into my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if I'm going to be here anyway, I want to be with <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we're in the same hospital, then at least...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I want... to go... to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> side..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"Right now you have to stay in bed and rest. Please, don't push yourself any further."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"Rest... until when...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"They say they'll treat your stomach tomorrow, and you'll be in the hospital for a few days."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"Tomorrow... can I see </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"I'll take you there in a wheelchair."</STYLE><PG>
In other words, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> will be the one looking after me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Forcing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> to carry the burden of my own selfishness...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"Can't Grandpa and Grandma... come here...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"I got hold of them, but apparently they're on a trip to Okinawa right now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And a typhoon is coming, so they say they're stuck. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In Okinawa, typhoons sometimes come this time of year."</STYLE><PG>
So in the end, I have no choice but to be a burden on <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now I understand, just a little, how <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> felt when she went so far as to call me a bother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to make <STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE> burden even a little lighter.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what time is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"It's 10:30 p.m."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what are you going to do now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"They set up a cot for me, so I'll sleep here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'll be right next to you, so call me if anything happens."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... will you be able to sleep?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"I'll sleep when you do, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But if you're sleepy, you can go ahead and sleep. I'm just a bit too awake right now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"Did something... happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"There's no point hiding it anymore, so I'll just say it: I got scolded by my teacher over the presentation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, when I explained that you'd collapsed, they reluctantly accepted it, but..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I... if you hadn't come, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... would I have stayed collapsed on the roof... and not been found for a while?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"I suppose so. Coming back was the right decision, if I do say so myself!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... why... are you... so kind to me?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"Because when someone important to me is suffering, I suffer too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―you never left her side, so you understand that, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
Now that I'm in <STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Haruka's</STYLE> position, it has finally <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ふ">sunk in</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> looks after me with a pale face, it doesn't make me happy at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I absolutely don't want to make <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> suffer over something like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've finally noticed my flesh-bound mask, by looking at my own mask from the outside.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... the flesh-bound mask... has it come off...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I finally understand... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">From the very beginning... I could only see things... through a narrow view..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> won't be a burden on you anymore, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'll say it clearly."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"So I won't... be a burden...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　It's okay... from now on... I'll take it easy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> flesh-bound mask..."</STYLE><PG>
