<STYLE ID="12">"Let me gooo!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Where are you going!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="12">"To </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You have to stay in bed!"</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="12">"No...! </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I didn't even have the strength to push little <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do is crouch down where I am and let out <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おえつ">sobs</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE> voice is drowned out by my ugly frenzy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It isn't sadness or anger, not that kind of feeling.<PG>
A fact that, normally, I should never be able to accept―
{PAUSE ""}
I'm trying to accept, without a struggle, that <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> hasn't woken up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somewhere in my heart, I myself had known it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> was still asleep, all this time.<PG>
I wanted <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> to wake up soon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With only that in mind, I kept talking to her every day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But those days, before I knew it, had become a burden to me, and kept destroying my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And little by little, the flesh-bound mask began to appear on my face.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\肉付きイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The story of the flesh-bound mask that <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> told is a legend meant to teach the importance of believing in the Buddha.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in my case, it's one to protect a heart that was close to breaking―
{PAUSE ""}
a mask to cover up the truth―<PG>
When I put on the mask, my vision narrows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my vision narrows to peepholes, I don't have to face the truth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way, my heart doesn't get destroyed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scenery I saw through the peepholes was a dreamlike illusion.<PG>
My face, which accepted that mask, has become one with the mask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My vision is narrow, and I can't tell for myself what kind of mask I'm wearing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But to the people around me, I can only look like someone drowning in illusion, still wearing a cursed mask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew―
{PAUSE ""}
I knew it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Soon my <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おえつ">sobbing</STYLE> turns into twitching <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="けいれん">spasms</STYLE> of my diaphragm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How will my heart take the fact that, since that incident, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> has shown no sign of recovery?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will it be able to bear it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will my heart just be broken, like this?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, let's get you back to bed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> pulls me by the hand, and I'm laid straight back down on the bed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... that I couldn't tell you all this time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not your fault, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was trying to look away from the truth, and that's why...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm the one... who's sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The words came out without my thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were sensible words, enough to surprise even me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems my heart is still alive.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I... must have wanted to run away... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wasn't a burden to take care of. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> ending up like that is the fact I wanted to run away from."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, until you burned out, you never, ever ran away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The stomach ulcer is a message from your body telling you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, to take a little rest."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Was this... for the best...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you look frail, but you're not a weak person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But... even so, you're not invincible."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I think the words I was hearing from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> were a voice that couldn't be voiced. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Even if </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> really had woken up, I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would say I was a bother."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I think so too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> might be able to hear voices even though she isn't conscious. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And she's been trying somehow to get that through to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you believe in something supernatural like telepathy?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, your intuition is the one thing I can believe in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then... even though </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> isn't awake, she's reacting to my voice, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I think I'll keep on talking to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Even if she doesn't look conscious, I'm sure she can hear your voice. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But please don't overdo it. Right now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> must be really angry."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right... I have to go apologize later..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
